  {
    "id": "N042-1-0001",
    "chapter": 42,
    "title": "蘅蕪君蘭言解疑語　瀟湘子雅謬補餘香",
    "source": "Dream-of-Red-Chamber-master/脂硯齋重評石頭記/chapters/chapter42.tex",
